#   rust/ module; substrate reads its own body via apply_h::act discharge.
# [[architecture-prism-as-trait-as-everything]] — `glass @mcp/serve` per
#   depth-≥1 discipline (Recognition #46; sub-shards use glass, family-roots
#   use prism).
# [[architecture-form-process-partition-at-family-root]] — @mcp family-root
#   at boot altitude carries FORM (grammar-decl + types + bilateral-predicate
#   contracts); THIS species-shard carries PROCESS (pipe-chain body +
#   dispatch match + tools list).
# [[feedback-substrate-already-had-the-word]] — @mcp family-root already
#   exists at boot altitude; THIS mint composes over rather than duplicates.
# [[feedback-no-rust-extension-shortcut]] — substrate composition first; no
#   rust/src/mcp.rs authored (per Alex 2026-08-05 substrate-honest reframe).
# [[feedback-rust-delivers-primitives-substrate-delivers-composition]] —
#   HARD RULE persisted 2026-08-05; wire protocols compose at substrate
#   altitude over rust/-altitude primitives.
# [[feedback-craft-not-deliver]] — Phase 2 forward-promises (serve_socket +
#   reflective grammar walk + @mirror/reload composition) stay `\`-obligation-
#   blocked; consumers pull realization when they surface.
# [[architecture-two-tick-discipline]] — mirror_spawn DEPRECATED alias
#   retained in Phase 1 11-tool wire; retires when bootstrap `spawn` arm
